{"Missing cleanup causes resource leak when V2-only enabled - when only ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ_V2 is enabled without V1, the event listener check for ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ fails so cleanup code never runs when clients, roles, or groups are removed, causing orphaned authorization resources": 0.862082839012146, "getClientsWithPermission returns wrong results for V2 permissions - the method searches for resources with type CLIENTS_RESOURCE_TYPE but client-specific resources created via getOrCreateResource don't have any type set, so findByType won't find client-specific permission resources": 0.6646870374679565, "Unused private method getEvaluationContext is dead code - the private method is defined but never called anywhere in ClientPermissionsV2, as the method that would have used it (canExchangeTo) throws UnsupportedOperationException": 0.3277670443058014}